msgid "# InternVL3.5(38B/241B-A28B)"
msgstr "# InternVL3.5（38B/241B-A28B）"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Supported Features "
"List](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) to get the "
"model's supported feature matrix."
msgstr ""
"请参阅[支持特性列表](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)获取模型的支持特性矩阵。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Feature Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) to get the"
" feature's configuration."
msgstr "请参阅[特性指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)获取特性的配置。"

msgid "require 1 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16) node:"
msgstr "需要1个Atlas 800 A3（64GB × 16）节点："

msgid ""
"- `InternVL3_5-38B-w8a8`: requires 1 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16) node [Download model weight](https://modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/InternVL3_5-38B-w8a8)\n"
"- `InternVL3_5-241B-A28B-w8a8`: requires 1 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16) node [Download model weight](https://modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/InternVL3_5-241B-A28B-w8a8)"
msgstr ""
"- `InternVL3_5-38B-w8a8`：需要1个Atlas 800 A3（64GB × 16）节点 [下载模型权重](https://modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/InternVL3_5-38B-w8a8)\n"
"- `InternVL3_5-241B-A28B-w8a8`：需要1个Atlas 800 A3（64GB × 16）节点 [下载模型权重](https://modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/InternVL3_5-241B-A28B-w8a8)"

msgid ""
"- Quantized model `InternVL3_5-38B-w8a8` can be deployed on 1 Atlas 800 A3 "
"(64GB × 16) node."
msgstr "- 量化模型 `InternVL3_5-38B-w8a8` 可以在1个Atlas 800 A3（64GB × 16）节点上部署。"

msgid ""
"- Quantized model `InternVL3_5-241B-A28B-w8a8` can be deployed on 1 Atlas "
"800 A3 (64GB × 16) node."
msgstr ""
"- 量化模型 `InternVL3_5-241B-A28B-w8a8` 可以在1个Atlas 800 A3（64GB × 16）节点上部署。"

msgid ""
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2`: Enable the dispatch_ffn_combine/mega_moe fused operator.\n"
"- The above parameters are validated in a specific test environment for reference only. Please adjust `--max-model-len`, `--max-num-seqs`, `--max-num-batched-tokens`, and `--gpu-memory-utilization` based on your actual input/output length, concurrency, and hardware configuration.\n"
"- For Ascend-specific options passed through `--additional-config`, refer to [Additional Configuration](../../user_guide/configuration/additional_config.md). For Ascend-specific environment variables, refer to [Environment Variables](../../user_guide/configuration/env_vars.md)."
msgstr ""
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2`：启用dispatch_ffn_combine/mega_moe融合算子。\n"
"- 上述参数在特定测试环境中验证，仅供参考。请根据实际输入/输出长度、并发量和硬件配置调整`--max-model-len`、`--max-num-seqs`、`--max-num-batched-tokens`和`--gpu-memory-utilization`。\n"
"- 有关通过`--additional-config`传递的Ascend特定选项，请参阅[附加配置](../../user_guide/configuration/additional_config.md)。有关Ascend特定环境变量，请参阅[环境变量](../../user_guide/configuration/env_vars.md)。"

msgid ""
